## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/local_plugins_allow_duplicate_rule_names/test.js'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "plugins": ["./first/noAssign.grit", "./second/noAssign.grit"] }
```

## `first/noAssign.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Diagnostic from first plugin")
}
```

## `second/noAssign.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Diagnostic from second plugin")
}
```

